Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.64,0:00:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.47,0:00:05.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的一集马上就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.01,0:00:07.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了找齐四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:09.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了用这把铁碎牙打败奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:11.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打败了蛮骨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟七人帮的激战 总算告一个段落的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到七人帮的 四魂之玉碎片的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新生奈落终于现身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:21.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚 七宝跟云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:23.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿梭于时空 发生在战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:24.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:31.93,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分散在蓝蓝天空上的 七颗星星{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:36.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一颗星星 都刻着我的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:40.94,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算梦想被粉碎 我也要寻找爱{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:45.04,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.18,0:00:48.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧抓着我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:57.15,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些骗人的光阴 我再也不会输给它{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.26,0:01:02.70,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁大眼睛 看清楚这瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.86,0:01:06.92,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它仍然紧紧围绕着我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.10,0:01:10.94,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人啜泣的 现实生活中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.11,0:01:15.17,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的…到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:18.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繁忙的这个世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:22.94,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永恒的碎片 忽隐又忽现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.05,0:01:26.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去触摸 去捕捉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.05,0:01:33.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.03,0:01:38.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到最后的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:45.10,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:07.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:45.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.13,0:02:48.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 我接住你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.71,0:02:54.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.41,0:02:57.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:58.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:01.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:02.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.55,0:03:06.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.39,0:03:10.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:16.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第123话 新生的奈落出现于黑暗尽处
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:21.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:24.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.68,0:03:33.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:35.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你这个傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.95,0:03:41.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛跑到这么危险的地方来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:46.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是交代过你 要你在外面等我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:03:56.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家真的…很担心你嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.81,0:04:01.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛担这个心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:05.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘦皮狼 你果然没有照顾好…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:09.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘦皮狼那个笨蛋到哪去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:14.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙已经被肉墙吸进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.39,0:04:17.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说瘦皮狼…被吸进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:21.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说 你最好马上离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:27.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 什么怪东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.11,0:04:32.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 快离开这
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:40.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个声音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:47.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.49,0:04:48.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可怕的一股妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一定和奈落有很大关系…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:04:59.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:03.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动不了了吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:06.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你…你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:28.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然能找到这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.46,0:05:31.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来想赞许你一番的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.27,0:05:33.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:39.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你马上就要变成我奈落的五脏六腑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.91,0:05:41.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是该结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:44.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么结束 你别作梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:46.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要结束是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.75,0:05:49.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也得等我割断你的喉咙再说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:55.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我们一定要取了你的那条命
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:57.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 受死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:10.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:12.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好烫…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:14.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是…强酸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:17.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 开始溶化了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.71,0:06:21.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:26.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:28.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:33.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.97,0:06:39.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:41.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道还不明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在整座白灵山 全都是我奈落的身体了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.98,0:06:52.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换句话说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.61,0:06:56.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们一个个都在我身体里面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:07:00.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座肉墙真的是奈落的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:04.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 难道我们跟钢牙一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.19,0:07:06.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就要被奈落吃掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:10.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别太高估自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:13.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还没有被吃掉的价值
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.07,0:07:15.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是没用的小妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:17.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是在说我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.27,0:07:21.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有像犬夜叉这种半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:25.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个人类就更别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:30.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会减损我奈落的威力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:34.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛮骨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:36.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.66,0:07:43.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们人类的愚蠢 简直是叫我作呕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:48.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像蛮骨这样的邪魔歪道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:49.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了帮兄弟们报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也敢闯进这个禁地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:56.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟犬夜叉你搏斗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.61,0:08:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把七块碎片给了七人帮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.95,0:08:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦这些碎片都得手后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:10.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不管什么报仇不报仇的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:12.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早早逃之夭夭不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.74,0:08:23.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏偏这小子…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫做人类的这种生物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:33.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在是太愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:53.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你这臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:08:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他真的像你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:01.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是邪魔歪道没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:06.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七人帮所有兄弟们 一个个都战死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.15,0:09:08.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我要替他们讨回公道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:17.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了让你更容易取得四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:22.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我故意用这双手跟你对打呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:25.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过就算如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:29.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可是比你正直几百倍以上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.10,0:09:32.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:38.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而奈落你居然…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:40.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这可恶至极的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:45.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛发那么大火呢 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.35,0:09:48.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛮骨可是先死在你手中的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.89,0:09:50.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:04.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:19.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不客气的收下了这些四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.80,0:10:31.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片已经合而为一了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.53,0:10:35.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于现身了吗 奈落…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股妖气…一定错不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.05,0:10:50.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您在跟我说话吗 杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.55,0:10:57.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 已经现身了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.63,0:11:03.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了杀生丸少爷之外
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.53,0:11:06.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么厉害的妖气 我还是头一次见识到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:09.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样跟下去 说不定我就因此送命了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:11.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.41,0:11:18.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你一战成功
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:22.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:23.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.55,0:11:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.09,0:11:32.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 马上就会结束
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.09,0:11:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道不用再等了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:39.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 已经不在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.84,0:11:48.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.61,0:11:57.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片全都聚集了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:25.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:28.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落的新生肉体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:32.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.22,0:13:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是可怜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.12,0:13:45.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些对我恨之入骨的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.13,0:13:47.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,费尽千辛万苦总算找到我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.63,0:13:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是现在却连我的一根指头都碰不到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:54.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 也太让我们扫兴了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:57.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你处心积虑地躲在这圣地里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.74,0:14:00.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还在猜 你是会变成多厉害的妖怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.71,0:14:04.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你错了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:05.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.31,0:14:08.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.48,0:14:12.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的妖气 不知比以前强多少倍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:14.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.82,0:14:15.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.99,0:14:19.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:22.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分明是奈落又在装神弄鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:26.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他那点功力 只会越变越差而已
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:36.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:42.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.02,0:14:51.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真爱开玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:55.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然徒手也敢跟我奈落斗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:14:58.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:00.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你那么想死的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:01.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本少爷就将你碎尸万段
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.07,0:15:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.51,0:15:17.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙 乖乖的受死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:18.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:21.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:29.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋一个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.67,0:15:40.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤被打回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.35,0:15:46.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:48.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:54.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤竟然停不下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:55.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.69,0:15:59.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 快躲到飞来骨后面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.99,0:16:01.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:05.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.73,0:16:07.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那个什么风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.50,0:16:10.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全被我的妖气控制住了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:12.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:15.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.74,0:16:17.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你中了奈落的计
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.74,0:16:19.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发动什么风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:20.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:22.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.09,0:16:29.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤会在这里不断地徘徊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:32.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直到你们全都被打成肉酱为止
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.43,0:16:36.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你这小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:42.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到自己发动的风之伤会害死你的伙伴们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:56.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白灵山里面到处弥漫着妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.49,0:17:05.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是奈落的分身 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:07.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她怀里抱的是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:22.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好险
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.47,0:17:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是桔梗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.51,0:17:26.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别乱来 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.14,0:17:31.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗轮不到你来收拾她
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.42,0:17:34.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来这家伙会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.52,0:17:36.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:53.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你到底又放走了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.94,0:17:55.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:06.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要让这阵风…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:15.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要想办法让这阵风停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:21.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉他们马上会死在这了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:25.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我也已经得到新的肉体
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:29.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩下最后一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:35.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你想逃走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.05,0:18:39.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.45,0:18:42.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快追 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.02,0:18:43.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.29,0:18:45.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去追奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.06,0:18:49.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了 可是你怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:51.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:54.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这阵风真的是奈落的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.03,0:18:56.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定我有办法让它停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:59.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更何况 刚刚我看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:03.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的脚底 有其他两块四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:05.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有两块
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.41,0:19:07.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是瘦皮狼的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.05,0:19:10.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙他是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.81,0:19:13.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我担心会被奈落化为他身体的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:16.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要救他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.49,0:19:19.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还得看他是不是还活着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:49.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都疯了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.52,0:19:51.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然从风之伤里飞了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:55.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:58.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那股妖气是绕着奈落转动的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:00.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管这些了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:03.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就瞄准奈落这个坏蛋射箭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:04.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:07.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看箭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:27.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,射中了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.67,0:20:40.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.48,0:20:48.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候还有心情关心朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:52.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在看不下去你们的愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.35,0:20:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤停下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.69,0:20:57.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.89,0:21:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这么关心朋友的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.63,0:21:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.53,0:21:11.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山要崩塌了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.24,0:21:18.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 是瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就特别开恩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.75,0:21:25.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你们跟好友们一起长眠
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.71,0:21:59.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.68,0:22:02.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就去见你了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.52,0:22:13.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}偷偷亲你一下 装作若无其事的样子{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.30,0:22:18.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这样调皮 是不是像个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.77,0:22:24.87,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早已习惯 被你说是娇嗔无理
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.01,0:22:31.14,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 「喜欢你」 这三个字却始终说不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.28,0:22:33.98,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}My Sweet Emotion{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.55,0:22:45.43,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对着镜子 多看一次 看看自己的微笑{\fad(400,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.26,0:22:58.27,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果想飞奔出去追求刺激就得挺起胸膛向前走
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.24,0:23:08.84,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大胆放手去做 直到满意为止{\fad(0,800)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.02,0:23:18.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}偷偷亲你一下 装作若无其事的样子{\fad(400,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.79,0:23:24.10,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这样调皮 是不是像个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.27,0:23:30.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早已习惯 被你说是娇嗔无理
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.47,0:23:36.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 「喜欢你」 这三个字却始终说不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.68,0:23:39.27,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}My Sweet Emotion{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.33,0:23:51.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不用担心 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.60,0:23:53.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会把瘦皮狼救出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.77,0:23:56.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉去救钢牙 就在短短的时间里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.54,0:23:58.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落已经出现在桔梗的面前了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.37,0:23:59.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.54,0:24:01.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真正的目的到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.51,0:24:04.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这块崩裂的地底下 已经布满了我的瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.48,0:24:06.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种假肉体
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.18,0:24:07.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是撑不了多久的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.51,0:24:09.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 这里就是你的坟墓
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.82,0:24:12.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.12,0:24:13.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了 心爱的桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.92,0:24:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着她死却没办法救她的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.32,0:24:16.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 是你
